#   v "(What is he doing??)"
    v "(O que ele está fazendo??)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:736
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_fd505708:

#   mc "Well, you see, karma is like this mystical thing, right?"
    mc "Bem, veja bem, o karma é como uma coisa mística, não é?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:738
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_6cefab31:

#   mc "It's supposed to be all about cause and effect, like what goes around comes around and stuff."
    mc "Supostamente, tudo gira em torno de causa e efeito, como se tudo que vai, voltasse e coisas do tipo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:740
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_ff453137:

#   mc "But honestly, who really believes in that? I mean, come on, bad things happen to good people all the time, and vice versa."
    mc "Mas, sinceramente, quem realmente acredita nisso? Quer dizer, vamos lá, coisas ruins acontecem com pessoas boas o tempo todo, e vice-versa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:742
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_fc88056d:

#   mc "It's just a coincidence, right? Plus, if karma were real, wouldn't we all be living in some kind of cosmic utopia by now?"
    mc "É apenas uma coincidência, certo? Além disso, se o karma fosse real, não estaríamos todos vivendo em algum tipo de utopia cósmica agora?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:744
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_13f2040f:

#   mc "So yeah, karma's a nice idea, but let's face it, life's just a random mess and we're all just trying to make sense of it."
    mc "Sim, o karma é uma ideia interessante, mas sejamos realistas, a vida é uma bagunça aleatória e todos nós estamos tentando dar sentido a ela."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:747
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_585536a7:

#   v "(Oh, [y_name]...)"
    v "(Oh, [y_name]...)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:751
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_efdec5e6:

#   drama_coach "What’s your name again?"
    drama_coach "Qual é o seu nome mesmo?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:753
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_3d7b39b7:

#   mc "It’s um... It’s [y_name]."
    mc "É... É [y_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:755
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_b4e09964:

#   mc "[y_name] Galvan."
    mc "[y_name] Galvan."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:757
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_0d94f6da:

#   drama_coach "Well, Mister Galvan, you need to hear this."
    drama_coach "Bem, Sr. Galvan, o senhor precisa ouvir isto."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:759
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_2f3c533d:

#   drama_coach "Let me be the first and probably only person to tell you that..."
    drama_coach "Deixe-me ser a primeira e provavelmente a única pessoa a lhe dizer isso..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:761
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_064464f2:

#   drama_coach "...that monologue was the worst piece of acting, probably in the history of theatre."
    drama_coach "...aquele monólogo foi a pior atuação, provavelmente, da história do teatro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:763
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_cc65322b:

#   drama_coach "That performance was like my ex-husband’s old coffee table."
    drama_coach "Aquela apresentação foi como a velha mesa de centro do meu ex-marido."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:765
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_be354fa8:

#   drama_coach "Wooden and boring."
    drama_coach "De madeira e sem graça."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:767
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_0b337b3e:

#   drama_coach "Do you know why?"
    drama_coach "Você sabe por quê?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:769
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_837e2f36:

#   drama_coach "I saw no truth in your monologue, no actual examples of how karma has affected you personally."
    drama_coach "Não vi nenhuma verdade em seu monólogo, nenhum exemplo concreto de como o karma o afetou pessoalmente."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:771
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_16e640ef:

#   drama_coach "It was like a performance from a high-school dropout reading from a dictionary."
    drama_coach "Parecia a apresentação de um aluno que abandonou o ensino médio lendo um dicionário."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:773
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_f48a0a22:

#   drama_coach "I’ve seen more life from patients in a coma."
    drama_coach "Já vi mais vida em pacientes em coma."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:775
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_92a03f4b:

#   mc "Wow... Harsh."
    mc "Nossa... Que cruel."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:777
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_bae62a57:

#   drama_coach "This is a professional acting class, Mister Galvan."
    drama_coach "Esta é uma aula de atuação profissional, Sr. Galvan."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:779
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_0196e467:

#   drama_coach "And my theatre is no place for phonies."
    drama_coach "E o meu teatro não é lugar para farsantes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:781
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_b5f20498:

#   drama_coach "I recommend that once this class is over, you return to that pigeonhole town you call Darkham City."
    drama_coach "Recomendo que, assim que esta aula terminar, você retorne àquela cidadezinha insignificante que você chama de Darkham City."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:783
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_69ed7411:

#   drama_coach "Because to be perfectly frank, acting is not for you."
    drama_coach "Porque, para ser completamente sincero, atuar não é para você."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:789
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_c39ccaaf:

#   mc "(I better get off this stage before I make things worse.)"
    mc "É melhor eu sair deste palco antes que piore as coisas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:792
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_0cdf4e43:

#   mc "(I sure hope [mc_v_address] never performed in front of this woman, because she sounds like a psycho hose beast!)"
    mc "(Espero sinceramente que sim) [mc_v_address] Nunca me apresentei na frente dessa mulher, porque ela parece uma psicopata descontrolada!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:803
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_59c9f7d1:

#   v "[y_name]! Where were you?"
    v "[y_name] Onde você estava?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:805
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_20050fb4:

#   mc "I was stuck in that stupid acting class!"
    mc "Eu estava presa naquela aula de teatro idiota!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:807
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_7f7f4d07:

#   mc "That teacher running it wouldn’t let anyone leave until it was finished."
    mc "A professora que estava coordenando a aula não deixava ninguém sair até que ela terminasse."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:809
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_add96b33:

#   mc "It was horrible."
    mc "Foi horrível."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:811
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_72573601:

#   v "I know. I saw it."
    v "Eu sei. Eu vi."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:813
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_15d4a291:

#   mc "You did?"
    mc "Você fez isso?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:815
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_a15d9145:

#   v "Yeah... I’m afraid so."
    v "Sim... receio que sim."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:817
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_586214a7:

#   mc "I honestly have no idea what I was trying to say."
    mc "Sinceramente, não faço ideia do que estava tentando dizer."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:819
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_44dc6fec:

#   mc "I bumbled through it like a clown in a circus, tripping over my own oversized shoes and making a fool out of myself."
    mc "Eu me atrapalhei todo como um palhaço de circo, tropeçando nos meus próprios sapatos enormes e pagando mico."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:821
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_871739a9:

#   v "I’m sorry that you had to go through that sweetheart."
    v "Sinto muito que você tenha passado por isso, querida."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:833
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_390f7755:

#   v "Come on. Get in the car before someone from the theatre sees us together..."
    v "Vamos lá. Entre no carro antes que alguém do teatro nos veja juntos..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:843
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_0391e75c:

#   mc "(No, I'm not letting this snobby bitch make a fool out of me.)"
    mc "(Não, não vou deixar essa esnobe me fazer de boba.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:844
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_95f1c654:

#   mc "(Hmm... Karma.)"
    mc "(Hum... Karma.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:846
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_031a5005:

#   mc "You want some truth?"
    mc "Você quer saber a verdade?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:848
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_ae7c30cb:

#   mc "All right, well here it is..."
    mc "Muito bem, aqui está..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:850
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_3388d24d:

#   mc "Karma affects people in many ways. Some may call it just plain bad luck."
    mc "O karma afeta as pessoas de muitas maneiras. Alguns podem chamar isso simplesmente de azar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:852
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_4f31d0de:

#   mc "You know the recent crime spree and the heist last weekend that everybody has been talking about?"
    mc "Você sabe sobre a recente onda de crimes e o assalto do último fim de semana que todo mundo está comentando?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:854
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_c9df986b:

#   mc "Whose to say that those people didn’t deserve it?"
    mc "Quem pode afirmar que aquelas pessoas não mereciam isso?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:856
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_34856311:

#   mc "Maybe it’s karma for them?"
    mc "Talvez seja o karma para eles?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:859
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_5803024d:

#   v "(He’s talking about us and the job we almost pulled off.)"
    v "(Ele está falando de nós e do trabalho que quase conseguimos realizar.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:861
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_779ebf34:

#   mc "Perhaps they did wrong to innocent people and being stolen from is just fair retribution."
    mc "Talvez tenham feito mal a pessoas inocentes e o roubo seja uma retribuição justa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:863
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_5251fb83:

#   mc "And I know what you’re thinking."
    mc "E eu sei o que você está pensando."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:865
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_dbc410a1:

#   mc "What the hell would I know about karma at my age?"
    mc "Que diabos eu saberia sobre karma na minha idade?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:867
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_7ecde29c:

#   mc "Well, karma has affected me too."
    mc "Bem, o karma também me afetou."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:869
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_b0d37738:

#   mc "I’m guilty of doing some bad things in the past for what I believe was for the right reasons."
    mc "Admito que fiz algumas coisas ruins no passado, mas acredito que por motivos corretos."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:871
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_320743b4:

#   mc "And I’ve done good things for people, too."
    mc "E eu também já fiz coisas boas para as pessoas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:874
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_66299855:

#   mc "There’s one person in particular who doesn’t always get recognised for how amazing she really is."
    mc "Há uma pessoa em particular que nem sempre recebe o reconhecimento que merece por ser tão incrível."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:878
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_c62efe9c:

#   mc "But I’ve been the victim of karma more times in the past forty-eight hours than most people are in a year."
    mc "Mas nas últimas quarenta e oito horas fui vítima do karma mais vezes do que a maioria das pessoas em um ano."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:881
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_9e2ee524:

#   mc "Whether it’s losing important files..."
    mc "Seja a perda de arquivos importantes..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:882
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_d02894a2:

#   mc "Or having my bike stolen or having a one-night stand with two beautiful women..."
    mc "Ou ter minha bicicleta roubada, ou passar uma noite com duas mulheres lindas..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:883
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_c0f03dcb:

#   mc "And then waking up to find out that they’ve taken my wallet, phone and also my goddamn clothes!!"
    mc "E aí acordo e descubro que levaram minha carteira, meu celular e até minhas roupas!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:887
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_34922d9e:

#   mc "Or having my bike stolen or having a one-night stand with a beautiful woman..."
    mc "Ou ter minha bicicleta roubada, ou ter um caso de uma noite com uma mulher linda..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:888
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_d9ca3058:

#   mc "And then waking up to find out that she’s taken my wallet, phone and also my goddamn clothes!!"
    mc "E aí acordo e descubro que ela levou minha carteira, meu celular e também minhas roupas!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:893
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_d45f3599:

#   "(Audience laughs)"
    "(Risos da plateia)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:898
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_1d4007c5:

#   mc "Yeah, you all laugh, but where’s the justice?"
    mc "Sim, vocês todos riem, mas onde está a justiça?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:901
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_967d36ba:

#   mc "Did I really deserve to be the victim of karma?"
    mc "Será que eu realmente merecia ser vítima do karma?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:904
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_edf2362a:

#   mc "I don’t know, maybe I did deserve it."
    mc "Não sei, talvez eu merecesse."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:906
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_eb0553db:

