#   mc "You seemed to know a lot about that theatre"
    mc "Você parecia saber muito sobre aquele teatro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1074
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_db324720:

#   v "What are you implying?"
    v "O que você está insinuando?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1081
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_1af8a983:

#   mc "I can’t shake this feeling that you had been there before."
    mc "Não consigo me livrar da sensação de que você já esteve lá antes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1082
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_802c8f6a:

#   mc "Maybe even more than a few times. Or you know people that work there."
    mc "Talvez até mais de uma vez. Ou você conhece pessoas que trabalham lá."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1084
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_cfaae932:

#   mc "Do you?"
    mc "Você?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1092
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_6459f587:

#   v "I’m sorry, [y_name]. I should’ve told you sooner."
    v "Desculpe, [y_name] Eu deveria ter te contado antes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1099
