#   v "You know the acting teacher?"
    v "Você conhece o professor de teatro?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1113
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_2f5861f0:

#   mc "Who? Miss Fonzarelli?"
    mc "Quem? A senhorita Fonzarelli?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1120
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_2a74bd7e:

#   v "Yeah..."
    v "Sim..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1122
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_7bb16043:

#   v "She was my acting teacher when I was a little younger than you are now..."
    v "Ela foi minha professora de teatro quando eu era um pouco mais jovem do que você é agora..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1132
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_e90e3b81:

#   v "{i}Many years ago, I auditioned to be in one of Miss Fonzarelli’s theatre plays.{/i}"
    v "{i}Há muitos anos, fiz um teste para participar de uma das peças de teatro da Srta. Fonzarelli.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1135
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_108390b1:

#   v "{i}It was a pretty big deal and all the actors who auditioned saw it as a chance to go on to bigger and better things.{/i}"
    v "{i}Foi algo muito importante e todos os atores que fizeram o teste viram isso como uma oportunidade de alcançar coisas maiores e melhores.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1139
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_6420349c:

#   v "{i}It looked like I was a shoo-in for the role.{/i}"
    v "{i}Parecia que eu era a pessoa ideal para o papel.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1140
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_2a0b9f4d:

#   v "{i}But when it came to deciding who would get it, she crushed my dreams.{/i}"
    v "{i}Mas, na hora de decidir quem ficaria com o prêmio, ela destruiu meus sonhos.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1144
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_7926f113:

#   v "{i}Not only did she give the role to someone else, but she called me to her office and told me that I didn’t have what it takes to be an actress.{/i}"
    v "{i}Ela não só deu o papel para outra pessoa, como me chamou ao seu escritório e disse que eu não tinha o que era preciso para ser atriz.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1148
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_43232d02:

#   v "{i}And so I never went back there again. Or to any acting theatre.{/i}"
    v "{i}E por isso nunca mais voltei lá. Nem a nenhum teatro.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1161
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_2d5d978c:

#   mc "But you’re a wonderful actor."
    mc "Mas você é um ator maravilhoso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1163
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_5fc7944e:

#   mc "I’ve seen you first-hand, watching from inside the van whenever you’ve had to perform as different characters."
    mc "Eu vi você de perto, assistindo de dentro da van sempre que você tinha que interpretar personagens diferentes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1165
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_a1f5b8b0:

#   mc "You’re arguably the biggest reason why so many jobs that you and [mc_vic_address] have succeeded with have been a success."
    mc "Você é, sem dúvida, o principal motivo pelo qual tantos empregos que você e eu desejamos alcançar são ocupados. [mc_vic_address] tiveram sucesso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1167
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_1f507969:

#   mc "It just doesn’t make sense. There has to be another reason."
    mc "Isso simplesmente não faz sentido. Deve haver outro motivo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1174
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_72df8932:

#   v "You know, I’ve always felt that I didn’t get that role because of who I am, and where we’re from."
    v "Sabe, sempre senti que não consegui esse papel por causa de quem eu sou e de onde eu venho."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1176
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_d7b36515:

#   mc "Do you mean because we’re considered to be lower-class?"
    mc "Você quer dizer porque somos considerados de classe baixa?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1183
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_86349bc5:

#   v "I’ve never wanted to believe it, but yeah."
    v "Eu nunca quis acreditar nisso, mas sim."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1185
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_e7a966b6:

#   v "I was always late with my monthly payments for classes and I think that ultimately cost me in the end."
    v "Eu sempre atrasava os pagamentos mensais das minhas aulas e acho que isso acabou me prejudicando no final."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1187
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_6be9b511:

#   v "It felt like a case of not what you know, but who you know."
    v "Parecia ser um caso em que não importava o que você sabia, mas sim quem você conhecia."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1189
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_30cbbf43:

#   v "And who has the most money."
    v "E quem tem mais dinheiro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1196
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_04247ee9:

#   mc "So that’s why you were hesitant to go in there."
    mc "Por isso você estava hesitante em entrar lá."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1203
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_4fc44c17:

#   v "Yeah... I didn’t want to give her the chance to humiliate me again."
    v "É... eu não queria dar a ela a chance de me humilhar de novo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1205
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_abdda9c2:

#   v "But I also didn’t want [vic_name] to be angry for not getting the job done."
    v "Mas eu também não queria [vic_name] Ficar com raiva por não ter conseguido concluir a tarefa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1212
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_995664a7:

#   v "Which was the most important thing."
    v "Que era a coisa mais importante."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1219
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_334b272d:

#   mc "I’m so sorry to hear that."
    mc "Sinto muito por isso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1221
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_98695e7f:

#   mc "I had no idea."
    mc "Eu não fazia ideia."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1228
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_6334e686:

#   mc "Why didn’t you tell me about any of this before?"
    mc "Por que você não me contou nada disso antes?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1230
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_99fe531d:

#   v "I was embarrassed."
    v "Eu fiquei constrangido."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_02_The_MC_and_Vivian_Infiltrate_the_Acting_School.rpy:1232
translate brazil lb_ep01_day3_door_options_44b739d5:

